      "rev_n_9_529442_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_9_529442_1",
        "node_id": "n_9_529442",
        "thought_text": "The current implementation correctly checks if both A and B are within the range of 1 to 9, but it doesn't handle the case where A or B is greater than 9. The function should print -1 in this scenario, but it doesn't. This oversight leads to incorrect behavior when given inputs outside the specified range.",
